{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：08:59 2026-08-04 HKT</p>\n\n<p>今日（4日）早上7時08分，觀塘碼頭廣場一名男子倒臥在3樓停車場內，頭破血流不省人事，保安員發現報案。現場是偉業街182號，救護員趕到，但發現事主已經死亡。</p>\n<p>警方經初步調查，相信事主由較高樓層墮下。現場消息稱，死者29歲，警員檢獲事主的隨身物品，當中包括一些財務文件，疑他因欠債尋短。</p>\n<img alt=\"警員用帳篷敝死者遺體，展開調查。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/6a548fd140a021b50d66909d919bff7d/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-04_at_08_39_48_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/184881f460c8b0d5fa7c7f14c0bf5100/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-04_at_08_39_47_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"男子墮樓，伏屍停車場內。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2fe2b66f5d791fb92cf8b12731218518/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-04_at_08_39_48.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/912ac7fd5a7ca564edb5003aaee6b009/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-04_at_08_39_47_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/51c3398d911017f5dc7fbb179b913c19/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-04_at_08_39_47.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場是觀塘碼頭廣場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d820f19368e8ae9fb013128888f635c0/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-04_at_08_39_46_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d018eb4459dbd10b9bf6d62b21c4facc/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-04_at_08_39_46.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-04T01:41:46.170391+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}